    "items": [
     {
      "type": "mainHeadline",
      "text": "A Perfect Day in Rio de Janeiro",
      "variant": "HEADING_XL",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro_title",
      "isBold": true
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>15. September 2026 | 2 min read | Ricardo Perna</b>",
      "size": "SMALL",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro_info"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Flugbegleiter Ricardo Perna verrät, wie sein perfekter Tag in Rio aussieht.</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro_description_0"
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro_separator"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Vormittag</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro_paragraph_0"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par0/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/de/article-images/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro/lh_app_rio-de-janeiro_cafe-nusa_breakfast_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Frühstückstisch mit mehreren Gerichten im Nusa Café"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Joggen am Strand von Ipanema</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro_paragraph_1"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Ich starte den Tag am liebsten mit einem Lauf am Strand</li><li>Die Sonne im Gesicht, das Rauschen der Wellen neben mir – besser kann ein Morgen in Rio nicht beginnen</li><li>Danach geht es zum Frühstück ins Nusa Café, wo ich besonders die vielen Gerichte mit Avocado liebe</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro_paragraph_2"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Nusa Café, R. Vinícius de Moraes 129, Ipanema",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro_paragraph_3"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Mit dem Fahrrad zum Zuckerhut</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro_paragraph_4"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par4/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/de/article-images/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro/lh_app_rio-de-janeiro_vermelha-beach_shutterstock437964253_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Vermelha-Strand in Rio"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>In Ipanema leihe ich mir gerne ein Fahrrad und fahre direkt am Meer entlang zum Zuckerhut</li><li>Mein Tipp: mit der Seilbahn hinunterfahren und anschließend am Praia Vermelha ins Meer springen</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro_paragraph_5"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Praia Vermelha, Praça General Tibúrcio, Urca",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro_paragraph_6"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Mittag/Nachmittag</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro_paragraph_7"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par7/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/de/article-images/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro/lh_app_rio-de-janeiro_cristo-redentor_getty157185619_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Rio de Janeiro von oben: Die Christusstatue Cristo Redentor wacht über die Stadt (© Getty Images) "
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Besuch beim Cristo Redentor</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro_paragraph_8"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Die Aussicht von der berühmten Christusstatue über Rio und die Küste ist einfach beeindruckend</li><li>Mein Tipp: In Rio bewege ich mich am liebsten mit dem Taxi fort – es ist die sicherste und entspannteste Möglichkeit, die Stadt zu erkunden.</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro_paragraph_9"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Cristo Redentor, Parque Nacional da Tijuca",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-rio-de-janeiro_paragraph_10"
     },
